FROM llama3.2
# The Task 4 synthesis prompt serialises the whole workflow state and runs to
# roughly 28,700 tokens. llama3.2 defaults to a 2,048-token context, at which
# the model sees only the tail of that JSON and describes it instead of the
# site. Evaluation therefore runs against this context-extended variant.
#
#   ollama create llama3.2-eval32k -f Modelfile.eval
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0
